  "GitHub Spec Kit provides a CLI, templates and prompts that move work through four phases: /specify (user journeys, business requirements, success criteria), /plan (architecture, tech stack, dependencies), /tasks (granular work items, dependencies, acceptance criteria) and /implement.": 1,
  "Spec Kit's /constitution command creates a project's governing principles and development guidelines, typically as the first step, and each phase requires explicit human approval before proceeding.": 1
